# Shell scripts must keep LF line endings regardless of a Windows checkout's
# core.autocrlf: a CRLF-corrupted shebang line ("#!/bin/bash\r") breaks
# execution when git (or anything else) invokes the file directly rather
# than through an explicit `bash script.sh`, as scripts/check-signoff.sh is
# once copied into .git/hooks/commit-msg.
*.sh text eol=lf
